 {t:"Start here",tag:"Do this first",tiles:[
  {i:"flag",b:"Start Here",s:"Your first steps in the back office",ack:"start_here",p:{h:"Start here · new to Goyal & DeCoster",steps:["Your login is personal. Never share it. Forgot your password? Ask Elsie or A.J. for a new sign-in link.","Read the <b>Brand Rules</b> (next tile). Nothing that represents the company goes out without Elsie's approval.","SignNow: accept the team invitation sent to your company email, then sign in with that email. The packages and the closing form are there.","New to Stellar MLS? Within 60 days of joining, finish three classes: <b>Starting Out Stellar</b>, <b>MLS Basic</b> and <b>MLS Compliance</b>. To enter listings yourself you also need <b>MLS Adding &amp; Editing Listings</b>, and the broker approves that access: ask Elsie. The classes come with your Stellar subscription.","Get your email signature: <b>Email Signature &amp; Brand Kit</b>.","Learn the everyday steps: <b>Start a New File</b>, <b>Contract Signed? Closing Form</b> (within 2 business days of a signed contract) and the <b>Naming</b> standard.","Questions on files, forms or brand: Elsie Benitez, Managing Broker."],side:"<b>Who runs the back office</b><br>Elsie Benitez, Managing Broker: files, forms, brand approvals, logins<br>A.J. Lash, Executive Director: the system itself<br><br>When you've read this, click the gold <b>I've read this</b> button under the steps so Elsie can see you're set up.",btns:[["Stellar MLS classes","https://www.stellarmls.com/learn"]]}},
  {i:"shield",b:"Brand Rules",s:"Read before you make a flyer or post",p:{h:"Brand rules · before anything represents the company",steps:["Every flyer, social post, email blast or sign that represents Goyal &amp; DeCoster is approved by Elsie <b>before</b> it goes out. Use <b>Submit for Brand Approval</b>.","Use the house templates in the Marketing Repository. Don't build your own layout: every piece shares the same fonts, colors and logo.","Spell the name out: <b>Goyal &amp; DeCoster</b>, with a capital D, a lowercase e and a capital C.","Keep the licensed-brokerage line and the Equal Housing mark. Add your name, license and phone in the template's contact block, nothing else. Never change the logo, colors or disclosure lines.","Not sure? Ask Elsie before you send."],side:"<b>The look</b><br>Navy, gold and paper · Cormorant Garamond headings · IBM Plex Sans text<br><br><b>Approvals</b><br>Elsie Benitez, Managing Broker",btns:[["Open the templates","#repository",1]]}},
  {i:"stamp",b:"Submit for Brand Approval",s:"Flyers, posts, email blasts, signs · Elsie approves",brand:1,p:{h:"Submit for brand approval",steps:[]}}
 ]},
 {t:"Your work",tag:"Three steps, in order",tiles:[
  {i:"plus",b:"Start a New File",s:"Pick your package, name it, open it in SignNow",nf:1,p:{h:"Start a new file",steps:["SignNow opens on your package's send screen, with only that package's forms.","<b>Name it first.</b> Scroll to the bottom. Under <b>New Document Copy Name</b>, paste your file name over the package name.","<b>Client 1</b>, <b>Client 2</b>, <b>Buyer 1</b>, <b>Seller 1</b> and the like are placeholders. Type each person's email beside their line, and your own beside the agent line: you are the first signer. One client only? Remove the second line in Recipients › Edit.","Click <b>Edit Document Copy</b> only to take out forms that don't apply (riders, lead-based paint on homes built after 1977). Required forms stay in. You work on your own copy; the company template never changes.","Click <b>Send Invite to First Recipient</b>. <b>You go first:</b> open the file from the email SignNow sends you (or from your SignNow Documents). SignNow takes you blank by blank through the main agreement: type the names, address, price and dates, tick the boxes, then sign. Your clients receive it only after you finish. The signed copy saves itself in your SignNow Documents.","<b>Next:</b> listing signed? Enter it in Stellar MLS. Contract signed? Send the <b>Contract Signed? Closing Form</b> within 2 business days. File complete? <b>Submit a Transaction File</b>."],btns:[["See the forms in each package","#listing-packages"],["Contract and agreement packages","#transaction-packages"],["Downloads","#forms-downloads"],["Open Stellar MLS","https://www.stellarmls.com/",2]]}},
  {i:"check",b:"Contract Signed? Closing Form",s:"Send it within 2 business days of a signed contract",p:{h:"Closing form \u00b7 how it works",steps:["One form per contract: transaction, parties, title company or attorney, commission, referral and disbursement.","Click <b>Start it in SignNow</b>. SignNow opens on the closing form only.","<b>Name it first.</b> At the bottom, under <b>New Document Copy Name</b>, type your file name and add <b>- Closing Form</b>.","Type your own email on the <b>Associate</b> line. Elsie and Freddy are already filled in as the second and third signers.","You complete Sections 1\u20137 and sign. Elsie completes the file check (Section 8). Freddy signs to release commission (Section 10).","<b>Before closing:</b> read the settlement statement (ALTA) line by line. Check your commission and the transaction fee ($499 residential, $799 commercial or land). The fee is generally charged to the client at closing; if the client declines, it comes out of your commission. Something missing or wrong? Call the title company before you close.","<b>After you sign:</b> the form goes to Elsie, then Freddy. When every document for the file is in SignNow, use <b>Submit a Transaction File</b>."],side:"<b>What Elsie checks before release</b><ol class=\"gd-ck9\"><li>Executed contract and all addenda in SignNow</li><li>Listing or buyer brokerage agreement in the file; commission matches it</li><li>Brokerage relationship and wire-fraud disclosures signed</li><li>Escrow deposit receipt(s) on file</li><li>Referral agreement and W-9 attached (if a referral is paid)</li><li>Your onboarding package complete</li><li>Split, fee and amounts match your plan</li><li>Closing date and the closing form logged in the Deal Pipeline Tracker</li><li>Transaction task checklist complete</li></ol>",btns:[["Start it in SignNow","https://app.signnow.com/webapp/documentgroup/template/85f95bd15094ed9399951529a10f336a202cb2b5/send-invite",1]]}},
  {i:"send",b:"Submit a Transaction File",s:"File complete? Submit it. Elsie reviews before commission",files:1,p:{h:"Submit a transaction file"}},
  {i:"doc",b:"My SignNow Documents",s:"Everything you have sent, waiting or completed",p:{h:"Your SignNow workspace",steps:["Open SignNow inside this page, or in a new tab.","Sign in with your <b>@goyaldecoster.com</b> email. Accept the team invitation first if you haven't.","Your documents, the Team Templates and everything waiting for signature are there."],btns:[["Open SignNow here","#signnow",1],["Open in a new tab","https://app.signnow.com/"]]}}
 ]},
 {t:"Forms & compliance",tag:"Brokerage standard",tiles:[
  {i:"lines",b:"Naming & Procedures",s:"One name per file, on every document",p:{h:"Naming standard",steps:["<b>TRANSACTION TYPE - ADDRESS - AGENT NAME - START DATE</b>","Example: <b>Lease Listing - 901 N Grove St Eustis FL 32726 - AJ Lash - 10-06-2026</b>","No commas, # or periods. The same name, character for character, on every document in SignNow. Later packages on the same file add a suffix: … - Addendum 1."],btns:[["Full naming convention","#listing-packages",1]]}},
  {i:"book",b:"Policies & Procedures Manual",s:"Brokerage policies, advertising rules, 61J2",soon:1,p:{h:"Policies & Procedures · coming",steps:["The brokerage manual is being assembled. Until then: every advertisement carries the licensed-brokerage line and the Equal Housing mark; add your name, license and phone, nothing else.","Questions on a rule: Elsie."],btns:[["Ask Elsie","mailto:elsie.benitez@goyaldecoster.com?subject="+encodeURIComponent("Policy question")]]}}
 ]},
 {t:"Marketing & listings",tag:"Brand kit",tiles:[
  {i:"plus",b:"Make a Flyer or Sign",s:"Type it in, add a photo, download the PDF",mk:1,p:{h:"Make a flyer or sign",steps:["Pick what you need: a property flyer, an open house flyer, a For Sale sign or an Open House sign.","Type your details. Flyers need one photo of the property.","Click <b>Download my PDF</b>. The finished file lands in your Downloads, ready to print or send to the sign printer.","Before it goes out, send it through <b>Submit for Brand Approval</b>. Elsie approves every piece."]}},
  {i:"lines",b:"Open House Checklist",s:"Your first open house, step by step",p:{h:"Open house checklist",steps:["<b>The week before.</b> Agree the date and time with the seller in a text or email you can keep. Not your listing? Get the listing agent's OK first. Tell Elsie the date. Add the open house to the listing in Stellar MLS.","<b>Flyer and signs.</b> Make them with <b>Make a Flyer or Sign</b> and send them, and any social post, through <b>Submit for Brand Approval</b>. Wait for Elsie's approval. Ask the seller, the HOA or the listing agent where signs are allowed.","<b>The day before.</b> Pack flyers, a sign-in sheet, pens, your cards, the signs and a charged phone. Read the listing again. Confirm the time with the seller and how you will get in, and ask them to put away valuables, medicine and mail.","<b>On the day.</b> Arrive early. Signs out, lights on, walk every room. Greet every visitor the same way and ask each one to sign in. Answer from the listing; if you don't know, say you will find out. Talk about the home, never about who lives nearby.","<b>Visitors who want to buy.</b> Ask each visitor if they already work with an agent. If one wants your help, take their details and ask Elsie about the buyer agreement before you show them another home.","<b>Stay safe.</b> Tell someone where you are and when you will finish. Keep your phone and keys on you. Park where you cannot be blocked in. Let visitors walk ahead of you. If something feels wrong, step outside and call for help.","<b>Before you leave.</b> Walk every room, lock every door and window, close the lockbox and collect every sign. The same day, tell the seller or listing agent how it went and contact each visitor who signed in."],side:"<b>Print it</b><br>The one-page checklist is in the Marketing Repository, under Open-House Flyers.<br><br><b>Questions</b><br>Elsie Benitez, Managing Broker",btns:[["Open the Marketing Repository","#repository",1]]}},
  {i:"screen",b:"Marketing Repository",s:"Flyers, social, letters, open-house kit",p:{h:"Marketing Repository",steps:["House-style templates and brand assets. Every piece already carries the licensed-brokerage line and the Equal Housing mark.","Add your name, license and phone, nothing else. Never change the logo, colors or disclosure lines.","Before it goes out, send it through <b>Submit for Brand Approval</b>. Elsie approves every piece."],btns:[["Open the repository","#repository",1]]}},
  {i:"mail",b:"Email Signature & Brand Kit",s:"Your signature file, logos, colors, fonts",p:{h:"Email signature & brand",steps:["Your Goyal & DeCoster email signature is built for you and sent to your company email. Ask A.J. if you don't have yours.","Brand: navy, gold and paper; Cormorant Garamond headings, IBM Plex Sans text. On documents the name is always spelled out: <b>Goyal & DeCoster</b>."],btns:[["Request my signature file",ml("Email signature file","Please send my Goyal & DeCoster email signature file.\n\nName:\nLicense #:\nPhone:"),1]]}},
  {i:"send",b:"Order Property Marketing",s:"Flyer, OM or website card for your listing",p:{h:"Order property marketing",steps:["Send the MLS number (or address), the photos folder and what you need: flyer, offering memorandum, website card, social set.","Pieces are built in house style and come back to your company email.","Nothing is posted publicly without your listing being active on the MLS."],btns:[["Request marketing",ml("Property marketing request","Property:\nMLS #:\nWhat I need (flyer / OM / website card / social):\nPhotos link:\nDeadline:"),1]]}},
  {i:"home",b:"Add My Listing to the Website",s:"goyaldecoster.com/listings",p:{h:"Add my listing to goyaldecoster.com",steps:["Every active Goyal & DeCoster listing belongs on the site. Send the MLS number and the address.","The card and flyer are built from the MLS listing; you review before it goes live."],btns:[["Request a listing card",ml("Add my listing to goyaldecoster.com","Address:\nMLS #:\nList price:\nNotes:"),1],["See the listings page","https://www.goyaldecoster.com/listings"]]}}
 ]},
 {t:"Brokerage",tag:"Support",tiles:[
  {i:"cap",b:"Education & Training",s:"Sessions, recordings, calendar",p:{h:"Education & training",steps:["The agent education program runs every other Tuesday at the office; the calendar is published before it starts.","Freddy leads; instructors from across the Red Rock group. Ask Freddy or A.J. for the current schedule."],btns:[["Ask about the schedule",ml("Education program schedule","")]]}},
  {i:"cal",b:"Office & Calendar",s:"121 S Orange Ave · conference room",p:{h:"The office",steps:["121 South Orange Avenue, Suite 1100N, Orlando, FL 32801 · (407) 693-7403.","Conference room: book through Elsie."],btns:[["Book the conference room","mailto:elsie.benitez@goyaldecoster.com?subject="+encodeURIComponent("Conference room booking"),1],["Directions","https://maps.google.com/?q=121+S+Orange+Ave+Suite+1100N+Orlando+FL+32801"]]}},
  {i:"person",b:"Brokerage Contacts",s:"Elsie · Freddy · A.J. · Raj",p:{h:"Who to call",steps:["<b>Elsie Benitez</b>, Managing Broker: files, forms, compliance.","<b>Freddy DeCoster</b>, Co-Founder & Broker of Record: commission release, brokerage matters.","<b>A.J. Lash</b>, Executive Director: this portal, SignNow access, marketing, website.","<b>Raj Goyal</b>, Co-Founder: ownership matters, deals and capital."],btns:[["All contacts","#contacts",1]]}},
  {i:"gear",b:"My Account",s:"Password, notifications, SignNow access",p:{h:"Your access",steps:["This page is for licensed Goyal & DeCoster associates only. Your login is personal. Do not share it or forward the page.","SignNow: accept the team invitation sent to your company email, then sign in with that email.","Forgot your password or need a new sign-in link? Ask Elsie or A.J."],btns:[["SignNow or portal access problem",ml("Portal / SignNow access","What I'm trying to do:\nWhat happens:"),1]]}}
 ]},
 {t:"My production",tag:"Coming",tiles:[
  {i:"chart",b:"My Commission Tracker",s:"Active → pending → closed, commission to date",soon:1,p:{h:"My Commission Tracker · coming",steps:["Your own pipeline and earnings, built from every Contract to Closing + DA you submit: active, pending and closed, commission to date, and your cross-company lines (capital introductions, awards).","Visible only to you and the directors.","Until then, your DA on file is the record; ask Elsie for the status of a file."],btns:[["Ask about a file","mailto:elsie.benitez@goyaldecoster.com?subject="+encodeURIComponent("File status")]]}},
  {i:"cockpit",b:"Leadership Cockpit",s:"Directors only · the whole brokerage at a glance",soon:1,p:{h:"Leadership Cockpit · coming",steps:["The same numbers rolled up across every agent and company, for the directors.","Opens with the director login."]}}
 ]}
